message: "If you use purgedcv in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "purgedcv: scikit-learn-compatible purged and combinatorial cross-validation for time-series and financial machine learning"
authors:
  - given-names: Evgenii
    family-names: Lazarev
    email: elazarev@gmail.com
