url: "https://github.com/eslazarev/purged-cross-validation"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - cross-validation
  - time-series
  - time-series-cross-validation
  - purged-cross-validation
  - purged-kfold
  - purging
  - embargo
  - combinatorial-purged-cross-validation
  - cpcv
  - walk-forward
  - data-leakage
